&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

a16z-gensyn:greenhouse:4337291101.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Machine intelligence will soon take over humanity’s role in knowledge-keeping and creation. What started in the mid-1990s as the gradual off-loading of knowledge and decision making to search engines will be rapidly replaced by vast neural networks - with all knowledge compressed into their artificial neurons. Unlike organic life, machine intelligence, built within silicon, needs protocols to coordinate and grow. And, like nature, these protocols should be open, permissionless, and neutral. Starting with compute hardware, the Gensyn protocol networks together the core resources required for machine intelligence to flourish alongside human intelligence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You tell us!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Further our mission to build the infrastructure to train ultra-high scale, open source, foundation models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Competencies&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy - able to drive things forward in a high entropy environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep appreciation of small-scale, high-powered teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Web3 experience - previously worked on a low-level web3 protocol&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Machine learning experience - previously worked closely with ML technologies as a developer or power user&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cryptography engineering (with a focus on GPUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding and navigating AI &amp;amp; Crypto regulations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cryptoeconomics and game theoretic design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation / Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary + share of equity and token pool&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully remote work&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- we currently hire between the West Coast (PT) and Central Europe (CET) time zones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visa sponsorship -&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;available for those who would like to relocate to the US after being hired&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-4x all expenses paid company retreats around the world, per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whatever equipment you need&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick leave and flexible vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-sponsored health, vision, and dental insurance&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;- including spouse/dependents [🇺🇸 only]&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Independence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don’t ask for permission - we have a &lt;a href=&quot;https://web.archive.org/web/20230526203438/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wLQ-rq4FgQA&amp;amp;t=2920s&quot;&gt;constraint culture&lt;/a&gt;, not a permission culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Claim ownership of any work stream and set its goals/deadlines, rather than waiting to be assigned work or relying on job specs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push &amp;amp; pull context on your work rather than waiting for information from others and assuming people know what you’re doing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate to be understood rather than pushing out information and expecting others to work to understand it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay a small team - misalignment and politics scale super-linearly with team size. Small protocol teams &lt;a href=&quot;https://research.contrary.com/reports/uniswap-labs?head=;;business--;;model&quot;&gt;rival&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;much larger traditional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rejection of mediocrity &amp;amp; high performance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give direct feedback to everyone immediately - rather than avoiding &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.paulgraham.com/say.html&quot;&gt;unpopularity&lt;/a&gt;, expecting things to improve naturally, or &lt;a href=&quot;https://verraes.net/2013/08/antifragile-nassim-nicholas-taleb/&quot;&gt;trading short-term pain for extreme long-term pain&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace an extreme learning rate - rather than assuming limits to your ability / knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Don’t quit - push to the final outcome, despite any barriers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be anti-fragile - balance short-term risk for long-term outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reject waste - guard the company’s time, rather than wasting it in meetings without clear purpose/focus, or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.techtarget.com/whatis/definition/Parkinsons-law-of-triviality-bikeshedding&quot;&gt;bikeshedding&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

a16z-komodo-health:greenhouse:8450293002.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We Breathe Life Into Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Komodo Health, our mission is to reduce the global burden of disease. And we believe that smarter use of data is essential to this mission. That’s why we built the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.komodohealth.com/technology/healthcare-map?hsLang=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Healthcare Map&lt;/a&gt; — the industry’s largest, most complete, precise view of the U.S. healthcare system — by combining de-identified, real-world patient data with innovative algorithms and decades of clinical experience. The Healthcare Map serves as our foundation for a powerful suite of software applications, helping us answer healthcare’s most complex questions for our partners. Across the healthcare ecosystem, we’re helping our clients unlock critical insights to track detailed patient behaviors and treatment patterns, identify gaps in care, address unmet patient needs, and reduce the global burden of disease.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;As we pursue these goals, it remains essential to us that we stay grounded in our values: be awesome, seek growth, deliver “wow,” and enjoy the ride. At Komodo, you will be joining a team of ambitious, supportive Dragons with diverse backgrounds but a shared passion to deliver on our mission to reduce the burden of disease —&amp;nbsp;and enjoy the journey along the way. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity at Komodo Health:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Project Manager leads small and large project teams through discovery, design, build, and configuration and delivers solutions for our healthcare and life sciences customers.&amp;nbsp; This role provides leadership and management to project teams to ensure we deliver projects on time, with quality, and on budget.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is the primary point of contact for the client, ensuring any risks or issues are mitigated and setting expectations for what is needed from the customer to be successful.&amp;nbsp; This person will work closely with all internal project roles, including the Solution Architect, Technical Architect, and Business Analyst, to ensure services are being delivered per the project plan and agreed Statement of Work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;97&quot; data-end=&quot;115&quot;&gt;Working Hours:&lt;/strong&gt; EST time zone overlap (&lt;strong data-start=&quot;139&quot; data-end=&quot;164&quot;&gt;6:30 PM – 2:30 AM IST&lt;/strong&gt;). This is a &lt;strong data-start=&quot;177&quot; data-end=&quot;198&quot;&gt;fully remote role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Looking back on your first 12 months at Komodo Health, you will have accomplished…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading a high-performing project team and customer through a successful design, build, and implementation by developing and establishing a comprehensive project plan that aligns with all stakeholder objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adhering to project budget and timelines by tracking resource allocations, monitored key milestone deliverables, and taken corrective actions as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identifying and managing project risks by developing a robust risk management plan to mitigate and address issues promptly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and leading Continuously improving on each project implementation by conducting regular project reviews, identifying lessons learned and implementing best practices for future projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will accomplish these outcomes through the following responsibilities…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategically build relationships with relevant customer sponsors and stakeholders with each project to actively identify and create future opportunities, customer references, and develop a robust industry network of contacts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own overall project management during an engagement; participate in discovery and requirement workshops to define and prioritize requirements, collaborate with project team members to design appropriate solutions, execute projects in a timely manner with clear expectation setting and communication to all stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage day-to-day operational aspects of a project and scope and effectively apply our methodology or client’s methodology if being used and enforce project standards; create, maintain, and own standard project deliverables (status decks, milestone kickoff decks, project plans, burn reports, RAID logs, build progress trackers etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage timelines, budget, and scope deliverables as documented in the SOW. Accurately communicate and report the project status to reflect risks or issues that may impact schedule, budget, or quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and manage project risks; Escalate and work to resolve major risks and issues so a mitigation plan can be developed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and execute project work plans and revise as appropriate to meet changing needs and requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify staffing needs and determine individual project team member responsibilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute and drive the change order process by working with the practice and functional leads, create initial documentation including estimates, assumptions, deliverables, and timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in customer training and other implementation initiatives as part of overall project deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to Komodo Health (required):&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong professional experience in project management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life Sciences/Pharmaceutical industry experience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management experience with software or custom development implementations experience - ideally in a consulting environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability and experience working in a collaborative environment to meet client needs with the ability to work across global teams, both internally and externally, to influence project contributors and stakeholders at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated analytical and strategic-thinking skills and experience with the complete lifecycle of complex enterprise projects; understand core project management concepts, data modeling, theories, practices, and methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience facilitating meetings, demonstrate brainstorming/consensus building skills, and interacting with project sponsors at all levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail-oriented with the ability to quickly assimilate and apply new concepts, business models, and technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with Waterfall and/or SCRUM methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional skills and experience we’ll prioritize…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PMP/SCRUM certification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CRM software, preferably Salesforce (Salesforce certifications are a plus e.g. Admin/Platform App Builder)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce and/or CRM implementations within the Life Science and healthcare space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;513&quot; data-end=&quot;581&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Komodo&#39;s AI Standard&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-sourcepos=&quot;9:1-9:347&quot;&gt;At Komodo, we&#39;re not just witnessing the AI revolution – we&#39;re leading it. This is a pivotal moment in time, where being first to market with AI transforms industries and sets the bar. We&#39;ve already established industry leadership in leveraging AI to revolutionize healthcare, and we expect every team member to contribute.&amp;nbsp;AI here isn&#39;t optional; it&#39;s foundational. We expect you to integrate AI into your daily work – from summarizing documents to automating workflows and uncovering insights. This isn&#39;t just about efficiency; it&#39;s about making every moment more meaningful, building on trust in AI, and driving our collective success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in shaping the future of healthcare intelligence.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Komodo Health has a hybrid work model with hubs in San Francisco, New York City, and Chicago. Roles vary — some can be performed from anywhere in the country, others are scoped to a specific region, and some are based near one of our hubs. For hub-based Dragons, we&#39;re building intentional in-office rhythms alongside the flexibility that&#39;s core to how we work. Whatever your setup, expectations will always be clear before you join.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Komodo Health provides equal employment opportunities to all applicants and employees. We prohibit discrimination and harassment of any type with regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;279&quot; data-end=&quot;506&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you acknowledge that you have read and understand Komodo Health’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;decorated-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.komodohealth.com/privacy-notice-for-employees-and-contractors/&quot; target=&quot;_new&quot; data-start=&quot;381&quot; data-end=&quot;503&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for Employees and Contractors&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;513&quot; data-end=&quot;581&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;This notice explains how we collect, use, and retain applicant data.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

a16z-loft:teamtailor:ff0bb112-b938-4534-.description:
Como o time de Transformation  constrói a Loft: 
O time de Transformation é um pilar estratégico da Loft, garantindo processos eficientes, escaláveis e conectados à tecnologia. Nossa missão é impulsionar inovação, governança e automação inteligente, evoluindo continuamente nossos sistemas corporativos e acelerando processos com IA, agentes, workflows e integrações robustas. Somos protagonistas na transformação que conecta tecnologia, dados e gestão para gerar impacto real no negócio e suportar o crescimento sustentável da empresa. 
Os desafios que você vai encontrar:  
Conduzir a evolução dos processos financeiros e sistemas corporativos, garantindo eficiência e escalabilidade, liderando iniciativas de transformação financeira e garantindo alinhamento com a estratégia da Loft; 
Implementar projetos, utilizando metodologias ágeis e práticas de PMO; 
Conduzir projetos de automação inteligente, explorando soluções baseadas em inteligência artificial, agentes e workflows para acelerar processos e gerar insights estratégicos; 
Atuar como ponte entre áreas de negócio, tecnologia e dados garantindo integração e fluidez nos processos; 
Mapear processos e identificar oportunidades de melhoria, automação e digitalização; 
Atuar como referência técnica e estratégica, definindo visão, arquitetura e padrões para processos e sistemas corporativos; 
Estruturar e acompanhar indicadores de performance, e usar análise de dados para decisões estratégicas; 
Promover gestão de mudanças, garantindo engajamento e comunicação clara com stakeholders; 
Contribuir para a evolução da cultura de transformação dentro da área de Finance. 
O que você precisa para virar a chave? 
Experiência sólida em projetos de transformação, melhoria de processos ou consultoria estratégica. 
Domínio de metodologias ágeis e práticas de gestão de projetos (PMO); 
Vivência com automação, IA e sistemas corporativos; 
Experiência em metodologias de mapeamento e desenho de processos; 
Habilidade analítica para trabalhar com dados (BI, SQL, Big Data); 
Familiaridade com ferramentas low-code e soluções para automação inteligente; 
Habilidade de comunicação clara e postura hands-on; 
Capacidade de influenciar diferentes níveis da organização e definir padrões técnicos; 
Proatividade, adaptabilidade e foco em resultados; 
Diferencial: experiência em áreas financeiras e integração de sistemas ERP, ferramentas no-code e gestão de mudança. 
Informações adicionais 
💳Caju - Mais liberdade para usar seus benefícios (Refeição, Alimentação, Mobilidade, Saúde, Home Office, Cultura e Educação);
🏥Assistência Médica - Sulamerica
🦺Seguro de Vida - Prudential
🏋️Wellhub - Acesso a academias no Brasil inteiro 
🧘Wellz - Plataforma de saúde mental 
👪Licença Parental - Para pais e mães
🐕Guapeco - Plano de Saúde Pet com desconto
🖥️Trabalho - Híbrido

