&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Have a track record of developing processes for forecasting, planning, and managing data center material for build-out and/or operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are familiar with data center network and compute hardware (e.g. switches, routers, cables, servers, PDUs, etc).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Possess a bachelor&#39;s degree in relevant domain or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
