&lt;li&gt;Direct pricing, go-to-market positioning, and sales training for new Alarms devices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the needs of customers and channel partners, ensuring Verkada hardware scales from small to large with simplicity, speed, and flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
