&lt;p data-start=&quot;1430&quot; data-end=&quot;1570&quot;&gt;At BAYADA, our people are everything. We’re proud to offer a supportive environment where you can do meaningful work and grow your career.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1572&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wh52qo&quot; data-start=&quot;1572&quot; data-end=&quot;1628&quot;&gt;A team that truly cares and leads with strong values&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;cyxy2z&quot; data-start=&quot;1629&quot; data-end=&quot;1694&quot;&gt;Ongoing training, mentorship, and career growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1pjscuu&quot; data-start=&quot;1695&quot; data-end=&quot;1776&quot;&gt;A comprehensive benefits package (including PTO, medical, dental, and vision)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1laimjd&quot; data-start=&quot;1777&quot; data-end=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;Recognition for the compassion and care you bring every day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1b27il&quot; data-start=&quot;1841&quot; data-end=&quot;1891&quot;&gt;A strong commitment to safety and quality care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
