&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications for a BAYADA Occupational Therapy Assistants:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
